# BookPondi_PMS: Complete Technical Specification & Data Model

## Executive Summary

BookPondi_PMS is a **lightweight, multi-property Frappe application** designed for India's hospitality SaaS marketplace. It provides modern property management, reservations, housekeeping workflows, and operational intelligence—without heavy accounting overhead (GST/invoicing delegates to central ERPNext).

**Target Users:**
- Property owners (homestays, villas, hostels, small hotels)
- Service partners (surf schools, tour operators)
- 250-500 room properties at launch
- Distributed across India with focus on Pondicherry tourism

**Key Philosophy:**
- One Frappe site per property (lightweight, isolated)
- Clean sync APIs to central BookPondi.in marketplace
- Operational focus (guests, rooms, staff, schedules)
- Financial data syncs to central ERPNext for GST/reporting

