### Module 2: Reservation & Booking

#### 2.1 Reservation DocType
Central entity linking guest, property, room type, and dates. Core of the PMS.

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): e.g., "RES-250001"
- `property` (link to Property, required)
- `guest` (link to Guest DocType)
- `guest_name` (string auto-fill from Guest)
- `guest_phone`, `guest_email` (auto-fill)
- `room_type` (link to Room Type, required)
- `allocated_room` (link to Room, optional): Pre-assigned room number
- `check_in_date` (date, required)
- `check_out_date` (date, required)
- `nights` (integer, computed): check_out − check_in
- `number_of_guests` (integer): Total guests
- `adults`, `children` (integer breakdown)
- `pet_friendly_option` (checkbox)
- `special_requests` (text): High floor, late arrival, etc.
- `reservation_status` (select, required):
  - Enquiry: Initial interest
  - Tentative: Awaiting confirmation
  - Confirmed: Booking locked
  - Checked-In: Guest arrived
  - Checked-Out: Stay complete
  - No-Show: Guest did not arrive
  - Cancelled: Booking cancelled
- `cancellation_reason` (text, conditional)
- `cancellation_date` (date, conditional)
- `refund_status` (select): Not-Applicable / Pending / Partial / Full
- `reservation_source` (select): BookPondi / Direct / WhatsApp / Phone
- `marketplace_booking_id` (string): Links to bookpondi.in order
- `notes` (text): Internal comments

**Financial Fields:**
- `room_rate_per_night` (currency): Locked rate on booking
- `number_of_nights` (integer)
- `subtotal_room_charges` (currency, computed)
- `extras_and_services` (decimal, sum from Charge table)
- `discount_amount` (currency)
- `total_amount` (currency, computed)
- `payment_status` (select): Pending / Partial / Received / Refunded
- `payment_method` (select): Online / Cash / Check / Bank Transfer / UPI
- `remarks` (text)

**Housekeeping Link:**
- `housekeeping_task_auto_create` (checkbox): Auto-create tasks on check-in/out

**Workflow:**
Enquiry → Tentative → Confirmed → Checked-In → Checked-Out
           ↓(cancel)               ↓(no-show)
         Cancelled               No-Show

