### Module 3: Pricing & Yield

#### 3.1 Rate Plan DocType
Pricing templates for room types (Standard, Non-Refundable, Long-Stay).

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "STD-001-RP"
- `property` (link to Property)
- `room_type` (link to Room Type)
- `plan_name` (string): "Standard", "Non-Refundable", "Corporate"
- `base_rate` (currency): Starting rate
- `included_guests` (integer): 2 (included in base rate)
- `extra_guest_charge` (currency): Per additional guest
- `plan_description` (text): "Free cancellation 5 days before"
- `is_active` (checkbox): Default true
- `validity_from`, `validity_to` (date): Plan period

**Rate Modifiers (table):**
| Modifier | Type | Value | Notes |
|----------|------|-------|-------|
| Early Bird | % | 10 | If booked 30+ days ahead |
| Last Minute | % | -15 | Within 7 days |
| Long Stay | % | -10 | 7+ nights |
| Weekend | % | 20 | Fri/Sat surcharge |

---

#### 3.2 Seasonal Rate DocType
Override base rates for specific date ranges (peak season, holidays).

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "SR-001"
- `property` (link)
- `room_type` (link)
- `from_date`, `to_date` (date)
- `season_name` (string): "Diwali 2025", "Summer Peak"
- `rate_override` (currency): Exact rate during period
- `rate_increase_percent` (percent): Or % increase on base
- `notes` (text)

**Example:**
| Season | Dates | Override Rate |
|--------|-------|---------------|
| Diwali | Oct 20 - Nov 5 | ₹4,500 |
| New Year | Dec 20 - Jan 3 | ₹5,000 |
| Summer | May 1 - Jun 30 | ₹2,000 |

