### Module 4: Housekeeping & Operations

#### 4.1 Housekeeping Task DocType
Daily cleaning and maintenance tasks, auto-generated or manual.

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "HK-RM-101-20251220"
- `property` (link, required)
- `room` (link to Room, required)
- `reservation` (link to Reservation, optional)
- `task_type` (select, required):
  - Checkout Cleaning: Deep clean after guest leaves
  - Stayover: Quick tidy during multi-night stay
  - Deep Clean: Monthly/quarterly
  - Maintenance Clean: After repair
  - Turnover: Between guests
- `priority` (select): Low / Medium / High / Urgent
- `status` (select, required):
  - Pending: Assigned, not started
  - In-Progress: Staff actively working
  - Done: Completed, pending QA
  - Verified: QA approved
  - Blocked: Cannot complete (needs repair, etc.)
- `scheduled_date` (date)
- `scheduled_time` (time): e.g., 11:00 AM
- `assigned_to` (link to User/Staff)
- `assigned_date` (date, auto)
- `start_time` (time): When staff started
- `end_time` (time): When staff finished
- `duration_minutes` (integer, computed): end − start
- `task_checklist` (table)
- `issues_found` (table): Any problems noted
- `photos` (image table): Before/after photos
- `notes` (text): General remarks
- `qc_verified_by` (link to User): QA staff
- `qc_verified_date` (date)
- `is_urgent` (checkbox): Escalate if overdue

---

