#### 4.3 Maintenance Ticket DocType
Issues, repairs, preventive maintenance tracking.

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "MNT-001"
- `property` (link, required)
- `room` (link to Room, optional): Null if property-level
- `issue_title` (string, required): "AC not cooling"
- `issue_description` (text)
- `issue_category` (select): AC / Plumbing / Electrical / Furniture / Appliance / General
- `priority` (select): Low / Medium / High / Critical
