  - Completed: Repair finished
  - Closed: Verified, resolved
- `resolution_notes` (text)
- `resolved_date` (date)
- `resolution_time_hours` (computed)
- `parts_used` (table)
- `impact_on_bookings` (select): None / Current Guest / Next 24hrs / Multiple days
- `guest_impacted` (checkbox): Affects staying guest
- `photos` (table): Photos of issue & resolution
- `sla_status` (computed): On-Time / Overdue

