### Module 5: Billing & Transactions

#### 5.1 Charge DocType
Individual line items that accumulate during a stay (room + extras).

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "CHG-RES-250001-001"
- `reservation` (link to Reservation, required)
- `charge_type` (select, required):
  - Room: Base room charge per night
  - Extra Guest: Additional guest surcharge
  - F&B: Food & beverage (if in-house dining)
  - Activity: Tours, water sports
  - Parking: Vehicle parking fee
  - Pet: Pet accommodation
  - Laundry: Laundry service
  - Late Checkout: Late checkout fee
  - Amenity: Mini bar, spa, etc.
  - Other: Miscellaneous
- `description` (text): "Room charge - Deluxe Double - 2 nights"
- `quantity` (decimal): 2 (nights) or 1 (service)
- `unit_rate` (currency): ₹2,500 per night
- `tax_template` (select): GST 5% / GST 12% / GST 18% (maps to ERPNext later)
- `tax_amount` (currency, computed)
- `total_amount` (currency, computed): (qty × rate) + tax
- `charged_on` (date, auto)
- `notes` (text)

---

#### 5.2 Folio / Bill DocType
Guest invoice/folio aggregating all charges from a reservation.

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "FLO-RES-250001"
- `reservation` (link to Reservation, required, unique)
- `guest_name` (string, auto-fill)
- `guest_email`, `guest_phone` (auto-fill)
- `property` (link, auto-fill)
- `room_type` (link, auto-fill)
- `check_in_date`, `check_out_date` (date, auto-fill)
- `charges` (table link to Charge): All charges for stay
- `subtotal` (currency, computed): Sum of charges before tax
- `tax_summary` (table, computed)
- `total_tax` (currency, computed)
- `discount_code_applied` (link to Discount Rule, optional)
- `discount_amount` (currency, auto-fill from discount)
- `grand_total` (currency, computed): subtotal + tax − discount
- `folio_status` (select):
  - Draft: Still adding charges
  - Posted: Final, ready for payment
  - Paid: Payment received
  - Partial: Partial payment received
  - Refund-Pending: Refund being processed
  - Closed: Archival
- `payment_method` (select): Online / Cash / Card / Check / UPI / Bank Transfer
- `payment_date` (date, conditional)
- `transaction_id` (string, conditional): Razorpay ref
- `payment_notes` (text)
- `refund_amount` (currency, optional): If cancellation
- `refund_date` (date, optional)
- `refund_notes` (text, optional)
- `printed_count` (integer, auto): How many times printed
- `sent_to_guest` (checkbox): Email sent?
- `sent_date` (datetime)

---

#### 5.3 Transaction DocType
Individual payment records.

**Fields:**
- `name` (doctype id): "TXN-RES-250001-001"
- `folio` (link to Folio)
- `reservation` (link to Reservation, for easy linking)
- `guest_name` (string, auto-fill)
- `payment_date` (date, required)
- `payment_method` (select): Online / Cash / Card / Check / UPI / Bank Transfer
- `payment_mode_details` (string): E.g., "Razorpay Order ID: ..."
- `amount_received` (currency, required)
