- `transaction_id` (string): Payment gateway ref
- `transaction_status` (select): Success / Failed / Pending
- `payment_notes` (text)
- `received_by` (link to User): Staff who received payment
- `deposit_date` (date): When deposited to bank (if cash)
- `bank_reference` (string): Bank deposit slip ref

